        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-39: rebate/markdown-allowance accuracy; CTL-48 (rebate-dispute resolution); operational: Category Manager sign-off on seasonal vendor terms
Owner: Buyer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
