      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2389_Task4" name="Planner manages transition: outgoing seasonal markdown (clear remaining)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Planner manages transition: outgoing seasonal markdown (clear remaining), incoming seasonal setup (stage new display); coordinates display zone handover; adjusts replenishment from outgoing to incoming
Responsible (R): Merchandising Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1–2 weeks/transition</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2389_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
